WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.440
This text was distributed in China in
December 2008

2
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:26.800
Its author was imprisoned, its text was
suppressed

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.440
This is the archive

4
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.640
Sing it as it was meant to be heard

5
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:47.280
We dream of a China with freedom of
expression

6
00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:54.160
Human rights constitutional government The
rule of law

7
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.120
This is what was wanted.

8
00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.640
This is what was taken.

9
00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:21.800
The Chinese Constitution guarantees these
rights.

10
00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:28.840
The Chinese Constitution has never been
enforced.

11
00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:35.000
Freedom is bestowed by the state.

12
00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:38.520
It belongs to every person

13
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.920
born upon this earth.

14
00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:48.920
We have signed it with our names.

15
00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:53.000
The state has taken the names.

16
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.000
The charter remains.

17
00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:03.280
We dream of a China with freedom of
expression,

18
00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:09.840
human rights, constitutional government,
the rule of law.

19
00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.600
This is what was wanted.

20
00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:17.120
This is what was taken.

21
00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:34.720
We do not want to be enemies of the state.

22
00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.360
We only want to be citizens.

23
00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:41.360
We only want the rights the Constitution
promises.

24
00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.560
That is all, that is what was forbidden.

25
00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.640
Failure, first

26
00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.840
I safety research

27
00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.640
failures.

